      "text": "D-Das kann dir doch eh egal sein! Was machst\\nDU überhaupt hier, hm?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0F0880773724E9F9",
      "text": "Ah, richtig. Oma, ich kann meine Maske für das\\nFest nicht finden.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gmother_11",
      "hash64": "24BE989E930703D5",
      "text": "Hm... Eigentlich müsste ich sie letztes Jahr\\nin den Schuppen geräumt haben.[VAR 0x0114(0037)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0037"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gfather_06",
      "hash64": "A482EAB30424FD42",
      "text": "Die Tür sollte offen sein, also geht doch\\nzusammen nachsehen.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0F087F773724E846",
      "text": "Alles klar! Wer als Letzter ankommt, ist ein\\nfaules Owei![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_brother_11",
      "hash64": "EDA34A03CD2164A9",
      "text": "H-Hey, das ist nicht fair![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gfather_07",
      "hash64": "A482EBB30424FEF5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Entschuldige den Tumult,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\r\\nDie beiden\\r\\nsind\\r\\nungestüm\\r\\nwie eh und je.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
